WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.940
<i>A nearly-forgotten memory came back to me.</i>

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.740
<i>The old sorcerer in a novel I 
loved when I was a child...</i>

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:11.710
<i>looked so glorious to me.</i>

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:23.160
The Faraway Paladin

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:47.050
Ligatur, Nodus, Obligatio!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:46.910
Be Tied, Knot, Binding

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:50.620
<i>That immense amount of mana...</i>

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.610
Sage... You know all, 
and still you fight it?

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.840
Conciliat, Sequitur!

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.840
Unite, Follow

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.850
<i>He reacted instantly?!</i>

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.600
Devastate

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:05.590
Vastare!

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:09.430
Pallida Mors Aequo Pulsat Pede...

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.440
Pale Death Kicks Equally

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.490
<i>A quadruple cast?!</i>

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.060
<i>Normally, that's the ultimate destructive 
magic that reduces all to nothing,</i>

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.680
<i>only usable by several 
people working together!</i>

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:20.500
Pauperum Tabernas Regumque Turres:

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.240
Both Huts of Paupers and Towers of Kings

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.830
Damnatio Memoriae!

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.660
Damnation of Memory

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.400
Curse you, Sage!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:40.400
Quaerere, Ambulare Alevita.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.300
Search, Treading Softly

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.260
Noli Fugito.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.260
Do Not Let Even a Sigh Escape

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.640
He didn't take your souls, did he?

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:46.790
N-Nah...

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:47.930
It seems not.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:52.290
That must have been scary for you.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.100
Sorry about that.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.050
It really turned out just 
like you were thinking.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:08.590
I was hoping we could hold out 
until Will was ready to leave.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.000
You two made your decision.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.650
I am not so unreasonable that I would 
demean the intentions behind your choice.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.160
But it has all worked out, so—

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.250
Old man!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.660
Blood!

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:41.130
To think you were able to destroy 
my body all on your own.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:45.880
Had I not divided my 
strength into two bodies,

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.840
that would have hindered 
me for quite some time.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.720
I commend you.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:56.320
You are indeed an exceptional, 
great sorcerer.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.370
Stagnate...

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.240
<i>Stagnate?</i>

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.920
It would be a shame to destroy you.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:06.880
I will wait until you've 
lost your attachment.

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:08.060
Now...

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.520
Gus!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.730
As for you...

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:18.480
You did well.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.440
This is all thanks to you, 
and you have my gratitude.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:27.440
These great heroes formed contracts with 
me and became the highest-ranked undead...

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:35.480
with the condition that, when they eventually 
lost their attachment to the High King,

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.740
they would fully become my servants.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.290
Because... of me?

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.650
That's right.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.730
Thanks to you, the Sage's 
attachment weakened,

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:49.380
and the War Ogre and Beloved Daughter 
lost theirs completely.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:53.260
You did a fine job living as their son.

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:57.650
<i>But... that's... I was reborn...</i>

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:01.020
<i>And I wanted to live right this time...</i>

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.750
It seems that was quite the 
shock, and for good reason.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:11.040
Oh, I know. Why don't you join my army?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.940
Then you can continue to live 
harmoniously with the three of them.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:18.110
But there would be no appeal in 
forcing you to decide right away.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.370
Tomorrow happens to be the winter solstice.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:24.770
On that loathsome day when the 
sun loses the most strength...

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.840
I will seek your answer in the evening.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.360
<i>I...</i>

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.400
<i>I took Blood and Mary's 
attachment away from them.</i>

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:51.100
<i>When Gus was against raising me,</i>

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.450
<i>when he taught me excessive 
amounts of knowledge,</i>

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.440
<i>when he tried to kill me,</i>

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:57.580
<i>when he asked me to lose on purpose...</i>

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:02.600
<i>It was all to stop the two of them from 
losing their attachment to the High King.</i>

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.720
<i>Still, when Gus tried to kill me,</i>

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.990
<i>I think he was conflicted.</i>

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.940
<i>I was just living without 
a care, knowing nothing.</i>

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:17.590
<i>I just sat comfortably on Gus's mental anguish, 
and Blood and Mary's self-sacrifice...</i>

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:21.720
<i>I was all hyped up about living 
my life right this time...</i>

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.050
<i>All I did for my parents was cause trouble,</i>

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.810
<i>and I couldn't do anything 
in return for them...</i>

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.000
<i>before they died.</i>

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.270
<i>How could I think it'd 
be better "this time"?</i>

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:34.380
<i>They're going to die because of me again,</i>

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.190
<i>while I've only caused trouble 
and done nothing in return...</i>

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.560
<i>Someone who dies useless...</i>

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.810
<i>isn't going to be reborn any better!</i>

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.150
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:56.820
Hey.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.520
Damn, your face is a wreck.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.980
Goodness, it is.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.060
You shouldn't sleep on the floor 
in the middle of winter, Will.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.880
I'm... sorry.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.330
Don't be, Will.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:21.170
We had to pay off our debt for the dumb 
stuff we did a long time ago, that's all.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.150
Though Old Gus tried to knock 
the debt collector into orbit,

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:27.050
blowing off his contract, and failed hard.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:32.850
Hmph! A contract forced on someone by 
extorting their weakness is no contract at all.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.790
He deserved to be knocked into orbit.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:41.730
It was rather exhilarating to see 
Stagnate's pale face being erased.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.530
You took one of 'em down.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:47.450
Maybe all three of us together could 
take the other one down with us.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.150
That's the spirit!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.020
Yes, I think it's a great plan.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.080
<i>They're faking it.</i>

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:58.060
Anyway, Will, you're all grown up now.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:59.520
G'wan, get outta here.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:05.280
Just be content to accept everything 
we've taught you as our farewell gift.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.700
I'm sure you'll be just fine, Will.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.190
Yes, that's what I believe, as well.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:11.070
No.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:14.720
You're wrong... I'm not...

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:18.790
I'm not who you three think I am...

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.880
Talk to us.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.940
I have my memories of my past life.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.170
I was an absolutely useless person.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:36.660
So when I was reborn, I thought I'd 
live my life right this time...

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:40.430
but I just made you three suffer 
without ever knowing anything.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:44.870
Even in my past life, 
when my parents died...

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:50.150
I have no idea how I felt. I can't remember!

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:55.090
After all the trouble I caused for 
them, I don't even know if I cried!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.760
I'm garbage.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.620
And again, I can't do anything...

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:02.350
I can't give you anything in return!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.650
I'm useless garbage!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.270
Will.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.050
Grit your teeth.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:16.720
Mary?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:22.530
Will, your mother will not allow 
you to hurt yourself any further!

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.390
You say you're garbage?

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:28.410
You've always been very serious and earnest!

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.570
And what of your past life memories?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:34.840
Why are you so shaken up just 
because Stagnate upset you?!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:39.170
If you feel so much regret just 
because your memories are vague...

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:43.180
If you're crying so much just for us...

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.170
Why would someone like you <i>not</i> cry?!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.520
Will, stand up.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:52.770
Stand up!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:56.100
William! Stop kicking 
yourself and straighten up!

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.780
Where's your answer?!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.450
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:05.680
You got chewed out 'cause 
you're being mopey.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:08.580
It would seem the little 
whiner has gone now.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:12.720
<i>I'm fine. I'm fine now.</i>

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.380
<i>Mary protected me.</i>

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.680
<i>So...</i>

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.560
I have a favor to ask.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:20.960
Please allow me...

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.100
to protect all of you.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.240
Virtuous gods,

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:30.400
I will soon go and fight an evil
god for the sake of my beloved

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.350
mother, father, and grand father.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.320
If you would see fit to observe my exploits,

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.230
please grant me a bit of your protection.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.510
So, have you made up your mind?

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.310
Yeah, I've decided, Stagnate,

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.730
evil god.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:10.390
I'm not giving you a single thing!

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.510
Surely a god such as yourself

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:16.580
wouldn't run away from a human child, right?

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.190
You have thought this through quite well.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:26.700
You hope to restrict my actions by focusing 
my consciousness on you alone, yes?

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.700
<i>He figured me out!</i>

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.110
Very well. I will play along.

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:33.720
But you are challenging a god.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:37.040
You must first show me you are 
worthy of such a challenge.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.420
<i>This is...</i>

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.140
<i>Those three said that when they 
became the seal's guardians,</i>

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.900
<i>they buried all of their allies 
who had been sacrificed.</i>

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:49.930
<i>But where?</i>

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.400
<i>That's obvious.</i>

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:54.800
<i>Right here!</i>

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:58.720
I am the god of the undead, 
Undead God Stagnate,

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.450
who leads an army of undead soldiers.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.940
So what?! I'll take all of them on!

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.920
Cadere Araneum!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.790
Falling Spiderweb

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.540
Acceleratio!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.300
Accelerate

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:31.730
Oh? So, somehow or other, 
it's this against a hundred heroes?

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.120
Hold!

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:49.450
I thought I would deal with you 
along with the three heroes,

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.240
but you exceeded my expectations.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.000
What is your name?

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.300
Will.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.250
I see.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.510
Will, I ask you again: will you join me?

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:03.750
I have taken a liking to you.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.890
Your strength, your backbone... 
everything about you is desirable.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.870
I will welcome you as a 
general in my undead army.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:12.770
What are you...

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.580
If you choose to come with me,

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.520
I will free your body from 
an unpleasant death.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:23.800
You will be able to live closely and 
harmoniously with your three parents.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.890
There will be no goodbyes or sorrows.

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:30.220
If we conquer this dimension, 
your relationship will last for eternity.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:35.280
Do you not find this world unfair, 
with its endless tragedies?

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:38.180
I wish to overturn that reality,

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:44.040
to create an eternally kind world 
free from the threat of death!

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:46.850
<i>He's probably not lying.</i>

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:50.300
<i>I can actually sense affection in his words.</i>

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:55.220
Come, Will! Enter a contract 
with me, as they did!

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.830
Now, drink my blood.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:06.080
By doing so, you can bid farewell to death.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.240
You're mine!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:03.310
First the Sage, and now you...

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:06.350
I truly cannot let my guard down around you.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:25.150
Huh?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.740
Did I... die?

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.520
This place feels familiar.

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.820
Like I've walked through here before...

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:52.920
It has been a long time,

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.600
Goddess of Light.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.320
<i>I'm starting to remember.</i>

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.910
<i>I walked under this starry sky before.</i>

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.520
<i>She was silent then, too,</i>

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.570
<i>but I remember her footsteps being 
filled with care and compassion.</i>

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:11.710
<i>That's...</i>

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:14.550
<i>I thought it was a star, but it's not.</i>

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:15.960
<i>It's a planet.</i>

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.190
What are those lights?

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.900
Traversing souls.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:24.610
They cross worlds to prevent 
the stagnation of all things.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.630
Why had I forgotten this sight?

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:31.960
A question.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.460
Yes?

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:37.110
Why did you reject Stagnate's invitation?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.350
In my previous life, I was a shut-in.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:47.770
Whenever anything got me down, 
I didn't bother to get back up.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.520
It was a pathetic way to live.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:51.860
But...

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.480
There's one thing I realized.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:58.990
Being alive and not being dead 
aren't the same thing at all.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.930
In my previous life, I wasn't 
dead, but that was all.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:05.470
I didn't have the courage to do anything.

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:08.240
Just the fact that I had to 
keep living was a burden.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:12.560
I didn't care if I died, 
so I wasn't really alive,

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:16.620
and by not being alive, 
I didn't have to fear death.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:18.860
So...

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:22.750
Because just a little of 
that memory stayed with me,

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:27.970
I was able to make the decision to 
live a good life in this world.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:32.350
I think that if I live right, I can die right.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:36.910
Denying death like Stagnate 
promised and living forever

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.650
would be no different from being 
shut up in that room again.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:43.620
No matter how much added value 
that has, I'll still refuse.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:48.000
I want to live and die as part of 
the same family as those three.

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:53.940
And who wouldn't want to protect 
their family, at least?

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:56.750
So please.

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:10.270
You are William, child of Blood and Mary,

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.690
soul who has crossed worlds.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.510
Yes.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:17.320
You now fully understand 
the gravity of life?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.110
Yes.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:21.930
And still you are prepared to accept death?

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:22.800
Yes.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.670
You fully understand the 
despair of death, yes?

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:26.360
Yes.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:30.990
And still you love all of the 
lives that will one day burn out?

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:31.700
Yes.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.930
I finally realized that,

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.390
thanks to your grace.

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:43.670
Thank you,

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.970
Gracefeel.

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:50.210
I have heard your wish.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:56.070
Episode 4
The Goddess of the Divine Torch

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:54.370
William, so long as you do 
not forget your resolve,

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.450
you possess the qualification.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.510
Now, wake.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.130
Make your oath, and we shall walk together.

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:06.200
Until your life ends and I 
come to guide you once again,

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:10.270
I shall be your guardian deity.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:27.610
Goddess of the cycle of death 
and rebirth, Gracefeel,

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.170
please walk by my side.

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:33.180
The blessing?

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:35.660
Even if you can use it, 
what do you hope to do?

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:39.260
Such a vague technique is no match for 
my blood coursing through your—

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:41.460
Stigma?!

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.700
<i>This is the badge I earned 
when I learned Mary's prayer,</i>

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:48.710
<i>my arms burned by divine fire.</i>

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:51.560
Now that I look more closely, your body...

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.040
How many Holy Communions 
have you partaken in?!

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:58.350
<i>Every day, Mary prayed to 
Mater for food to sustain me.</i>

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:03.430
<i>Mary's daily prayers, her unyielding 
heart, will not bend to you!</i>

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.920
And I swear to you, my god...

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:10.440
Yeah. The stronger your vow, 
the easier it is to earn it.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:14.980
But they also say that you'll be destined 
to suffer many hardships in exchange.

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.630
<i>I will offer up my life to you!</i>

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.950
<i>I will be as your sword to banish evil,</i>

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:25.700
<i>and be as your hand to save the suffering!</i>

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.210
<i>I swear it on the flame of Gracefeel!</i>

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:31.380
You've earned the divine 
protection of Gracefeel?!

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:34.270
A shame... Such a shame.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:37.080
I had so hoped to add you to my ranks.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.960
But if you have been taken 
in by her, I have no choice.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.310
Stagnate, God of the Undead,

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.790
I will defeat you and fulfill my oath!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:49.800
Young hero, die amidst your own resolution!

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:51.110
Kill him!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:56.270
<i>It's okay. I know what I need to do.</i>

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:03.610
Th-The Divine Torch?!

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:08.860
Gracefeel's divine protection grants peace 
and guidance to the souls of the dead!

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:11.900
How dare a fledgling priest—

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:13.340
Acceleratio!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.210
Accelerate

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.930
Vastare!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:15.670
Devastate

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:25.120
<i>Where will he come from?</i>

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.890
<i>If he makes any careless moves, 
I'll leap straight at him</i>

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.060
<i>and deal the finishing blow!</i>

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.400
<i>Stagnate is consumed by 
the desire to kill me.</i>

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.140
<i>We're on even footing.</i>

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.670
<i>If I fight him now...</i>

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:45.380
Was that a warning?

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.750
<i>What if he's not consumed at all?</i>

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.010
No! The temple!

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.000
Accelerate

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:54.370
Acceleratio!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.640
<i>It was all a bluff!</i>

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.920
<i>He was pretending to be consumed by rage,</i>

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:01.030
<i>and then he used the cloud of dust...</i>

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.430
<i>It's Blood and Mary that he's after!</i>

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:39.970
Episode 5
The Helmet of Will
